{"seq":19,"slug":"architecture-decision-records","title":"架构决策记录与文档","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"架构决策记录与文档-简介\">架构决策记录与文档 简介</h1><p>在软件系统的生命周期中，架构决策是塑造系统形态的核心驱动力。每一个关于技术选型、模块划分、通信协议的选择，都会在数月乃至数年后深刻影响系统的可维护性、可扩展性和团队协作效率。然而，这些关键决策往往在会议室的白板上诞生，在即时通讯工具的消息流中被讨论，最终只存留在少数参与者的记忆中。当团队成员变动、系统规模增长时，决策的上下文便不可避免地流失。</p>\n<p>架构决策记录与文档体系正是为解决这一根本性问题而设计的方法论集合。它不仅关注如何用轻量级文档捕获单个决策，更关注如何建立一套完整的决策治理机制——从提案到评审、从可视化到追溯、从个人实践到组织级制度。</p>\n<p>本知识库围绕四个核心主题展开系统性讲解。第一章<strong>ADR 基础</strong>深入探讨架构决策记录的核心理念，包括为什么要记录决策、如何设计适合团队的模板，以及决策记录的完整生命周期管理。第二章<strong>架构可视化</strong>聚焦于如何将系统架构转化为层次清晰的视觉表达，重点介绍 C4 模型的四层抽象、架构图即代码的实践以及 Mermaid 和 PlantUML 等工具的高效使用方法。第三章<strong>RFC 与设计文档</strong>讲解如何在团队中建立规范的技术提案流程，涵盖 RFC 文档的结构设计、Google/Uber 风格的设计文档模板以及异步评审机制的落地策略。第四章<strong>决策治理</strong>将视角提升到组织层面，介绍技术雷达如何指导技术选型方向、架构评审委员会如何保障决策质量，以及演进式架构文档如何适应快速变化的技术环境。</p>\n<p>本知识库适合软件架构师、技术负责人、高级工程师以及所有参与技术决策的从业者。无论你是希望在团队中引入 ADR 实践的初学者，还是正在构建组织级架构治理体系的架构师，都能在此找到从理论到落地的完整指引。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先掌握 ADR 基础建立决策记录习惯，再学习架构可视化提升表达能力，然后通过 RFC 流程实现团队协作，最后在决策治理层面建立长效机制。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adr-fundamentals","title":"ADR 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adr-value-and-principles","title":"决策记录的价值与原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals/adr-value-and-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adr-template-design","title":"ADR 模板设计与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals/adr-template-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"adr-lifecycle-and-toolchain","title":"ADR 生命周期与工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/adr-fundamentals/adr-lifecycle-and-toolchain"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture-visualization","title":"架构可视化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"c4-model-deep-dive","title":"C4 模型深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/c4-model-deep-dive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"diagrams-as-code","title":"架构图即代码实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/diagrams-as-code"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mermaid-collaboration","title":"Mermaid 与团队协作图表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/architecture-visualization/mermaid-collaboration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"rfc-and-design-docs","title":"RFC 与设计文档","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/rfc-and-design-docs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rfc-process-design","title":"RFC 流程设计与落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/rfc-and-design-docs/rfc-process-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-doc-templates","title":"设计文档模板与写作方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/rfc-and-design-docs/design-doc-templates"},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-review-mechanism","title":"异步评审与决策机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/rfc-and-design-docs/async-review-mechanism"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"decision-governance","title":"决策治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/decision-governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-radar-governance","title":"技术雷达与技术选型治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/decision-governance/tech-radar-governance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture-review-board","title":"架构评审委员会运作机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/decision-governance/architecture-review-board"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evolutionary-architecture-docs","title":"演进式架构文档体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/decision-governance/evolutionary-architecture-docs"}]}]}